{"3724650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Owl Lights", "steam_appid": 3724650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Owl Lights is a first-person psychological horror game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as 16-year-old Paul, who lives in the small town of Windville, where rumors about a cult are beginning to spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your parents have gone out of town, leaving you to spend the night alone-or so you think. What was supposed to be a pleasant night at home quickly takes a twisted turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The neighborhood feels unusually quiet this evening, as if something is about to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only way to contact your parents-your phone suddenly loses signal, leaving you isolated as you face a night filled with twisted, surreal terrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724650/extras/93413064b195c260312beb8a9d6576bf.poster.avif?t=1759004709\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724650/extras/93413064b195c260312beb8a9d6576bf.webm?t=1759004709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724650/extras/93413064b195c260312beb8a9d6576bf.mp4?t=1759004709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful, haunting environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><